\f1

\c7Hackers Association of America book of laws section #1 paragraph 3 states\c1:

       \c3It is against our laws for two hackers to combat two fighting turns
       in a row because it does not give the opposing player a chance to fix
       his/her damaged drive\c1.  \c3If you run into this situation, try battling
       someone else\c1.
